  "about": {
    "title": "I’m a product designerer with 10+ years of experience.",
    "seoTitle": "Product designer Portfolio",
    "seoDescription": "Product designer Portfolio",
    "subtitle": "ABOUT ME",   
    "textPart1": "I'm a senior product designer working on B2B SaaS in Tokyo. Over the past 10 years I've grown from designing features into shaping product strategy through design systems, structured experiments, and data-informed decisions. Working in a bilingual environment alongside PMs, engineers, and users has taught me how to balance business goals, engineering constraints, and user needs.</br> I prototype in code to validate complex interactions before development commits.</br></br> Lately, my focus has been on de-risking AI product bets and exploring agentic design systems: restructuring design systems so AI tools can generate full designs and prototypes that conform to the rules. ",
